# ── Raw QGIS exports / source media (local only) ────────────────
# These are the originals straight out of QGIS (HEVC .mp4 + full-res .png).
# The web-optimised copies that the site actually serves live in
# assets/video/ and assets/img/ and ARE tracked — the site cannot
# display media that isn't published.
/*.mp4
/*.png
/*.tif
/*.tiff
/*.qgz
/*.qgs
/*.gpkg

